---
source: system/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"ipcs\")"
---
Show information on System V IPC facilities.

Reads /proc/sysvipc/{shm,msg,sem} to display active IPC resources, system limits, or usage
summaries.

Usage: ipcs [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -m, --shmems
          Show shared memory segments

  -q, --queues
          Show message queues

  -s, --semaphores
          Show semaphore arrays

  -a, --all
          Show all three resource types

  -l, --limits
          Show system resource limits

  -u, --summary
          Show usage summary

  -b, --bytes
          Show sizes in bytes

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
